  "content": "<h2>创建列车实用工具</h2>\n<p>请查看我的其他模组：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-train-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">创建列车灯</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-more-seats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">创建更多座位</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a635c36ba47a58fc5de5b3e084aa9e25c1871f0c_0.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Create插件，添加具有逼真开合声音的自定义滑动门、站台方块以及用于车站和火车的建筑方块。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DkcprwueFj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/1248636479627071488/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<h3>概述视频</h3>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe height=\"300\" width=\"550px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6UIf8k9GgcA?si=8tsJUINk280wyiXJ\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3>新滑动门</h3>\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2702f13c969bc4c6521c1b0cef35cad7b101573a.png\" alt=\"img_one\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/697d14569ed64068758cfe20f35e403cfedd9d16.png\" alt=\"img_two\"></div>\n<p>还有更多！</p>\n<h3>站台方块</h3>\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/61ac8022a74457ccbd7475b924eed414b2e49c03.png\" alt=\"img_one\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e1c85d452b513e3de02fd9bc613853b08cc97b18.png\" alt=\"img_two\"></div>\n<p>还有更多！</p>\n<h3>更多功能</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>开合声音</li>\n<li>自动关闭的门</li>\n<li>所有车厢上的门均可控制</li>\n<li>等等！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>语言</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>English</li>\n<li>German</li>\n<li>Spanish (by Timanfour, AlbertoSaurio)</li>\n<li>Czech (by Panzimy)</li>\n<li>Russian (by Best-Jaro)</li>\n<li>French (by Alba0404)</li>\n<li>Chinese (by Jim139129)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>重要！</h2>\n<p>安装模组更新前请始终备份您的世界，以保护您的世界免受损坏。</p>\n<h2>支持我</h2>\n<p>如果您想支持我和我的工作，请访问我的 Ko-fi 页面 ❤️</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fadeptstack_programmerlp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/ProgrammerLP/Create-Trainutilities/wiki/Credits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">致谢</a></p>",
